    I’m always happy to connect, whether it’s a professional inquiry, a question about one of my posts, a collaboration or a request for
    <a href="/services">code review, system design or sparring</a>.
  </p>
  <p>Write me a message using the form below, and I’ll get back to you as soon as I can.</p>
  <ContactForm lang="en" />
  <p class="meta">
    The form is delivered by HeroTofu. What happens with your data is described in the <a href="/de/datenschutz" hreflang="de">privacy policy</a>
    (German).
  </p>
</TextPage>
